# AI Finance Controller

Build agents that close one finance-ops loop across a 50+ record batch of synthetic
data, then report match rate and an honest exception list.

## Directions (pick/close one loop end-to-end)
- Multi-source reconciliation
- Settlement Q&A agent
- Forward cash forecaster
- Tax-line matcher

## The bar (non-negotiable)
- **Throughput**: process a batch of 50+ synthetic records, not a cherry-picked row.
- **Measured accuracy**: compute and print the match rate over the whole batch.
- **Honest exceptions**: list every record the agent could NOT resolve, with the reason. Never hide or auto-pass unresolved items.

## Implementation rules
- Generate synthetic datasets deterministically (fixed seed) so runs are reproducible.
- Verification > generation speed. Every result must be checkable: log inputs, decisions, and confidence per record.
- Output a structured report: `total`, `matched`, `match_rate`, `exceptions[]` (with record id + reason).
- No silent failures — an unhandled record is an exception, not a pass.
